OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Children failed' after call for
OL,4,Anew school rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire County Council has
OL,7,Frepeatedly failed children in part of
OL,8,FPreston, a father campaigning for a new
OL,9,Fsecondary school to be built in the
OL,10,Farea has said.
OL,12,FStuart Finch is among those raising
OL,13,Fconcerns after having children and
OL,14,Frealising that while a large
OL,15,Fhouse-building project continues in
OL,16,FCottam, there is no local secondary
OL,17,Feducation provision.
OL,19,FThe nearest high schools are in
OL,20,FAshton-on-Ribble - more than three
OL,21,Fmiles (nearly 5km) away - or in the
OL,22,Fcity centre.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
