OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Children failed' after call for
OL,4,Anew school rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinch is now calling on the council to
OL,7,Frethink plans for a school on land off
OL,8,FSandy Lane after they were pushed back
OL,9,Fto at least 2031. The council has
OL,10,Fpreviously announced it would be
OL,11,Fincreasing places at two other Preston
OL,12,Fschools.
